📝 To-Do List Application

A modern and responsive To-Do List Application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. It helps users organize daily tasks, manage priorities, track deadlines, and improve productivity.

🚀 Features

- ➕ Add new tasks
- ✏️ Edit existing tasks
- 🗑️ Delete tasks
- ✅ Mark tasks as completed
- 🔍 Search tasks
- 🔽 Filter tasks by status
- 📂 Task categories (Study, Work, Personal, Other)
- ⭐ Task priorities (High, Medium, Low)
- 📅 Set task due dates
- 🌙 Dark Mode / Light Mode
- 💾 Save tasks using LocalStorage
- 📊 Total, Completed and Pending task counters
- 📋 Kanban Board (To Do, In Progress, Completed) – integration in progress

🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5 – Structure
- CSS3 – Styling and Responsive Design
- JavaScript – Functionality and Logic
- Browser LocalStorage – Data Storage

📁 Project Structure

To-Do-List-App/
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
└── README.md

💻 How to Run the Project

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Open "index.html" in your browser.
4. Start adding and managing your tasks.

